    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Darwinia</i> is a unique mix of real-time strategy, action, and puzzles, featuring an innovative gesture-based control system. Save the Darwinians, battle viruses, and solve challenges to restore order in a stunning, retro-inspired digital world. Winner of multiple prestigious awards, including the Seumas McNally Grand Prize at IGF 2006, <i>Darwinia</i> is a must-play for strategy and action fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/9163bbddedadbafb49a6bc8c5518ab57.webp?t=1747681440\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/5ac0be982c8b2479dcad9da299ce8307.poster.avif?t=1747681440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/5ac0be982c8b2479dcad9da299ce8307.webm?t=1747681440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/5ac0be982c8b2479dcad9da299ce8307.mp4?t=1747681440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Step into the vibrant world of Darwinia, a digital theme park created by the eccentric Dr. Sepulveda, where evolving AI creatures called Darwinians live. Their peaceful existence is disrupted by a dangerous virus, and as a hacker, it's up to you to save them. Dive into this corrupted digital realm, battle the virus, and uncover the mysteries threatening the Darwinians' survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/6896c02abb07cac00c9b223705107541.webp?t=1747681440\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/ffc78607a4c0e945fb3ffa8672a44411.poster.avif?t=1747681440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/ffc78607a4c0e945fb3ffa8672a44411.webm?t=1747681440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/ffc78607a4c0e945fb3ffa8672a44411.mp4?t=1747681440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Darwinia blends real-time strategy, action, and puzzles in an exciting mix. Control &quot;programs&quot; to fight viruses, herd Darwinians, and complete objectives. With a unique gesture-based control system, you draw shapes to summon units, adding a fresh twist to the strategy genre. As you progress, new abilities and tougher challenges keep the gameplay engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/7be0811af043750744c476ef00a1d5e9.webp?t=1747681440\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/5e0a3303d009ce95f9875a93a6dfd69f.poster.avif?t=1747681440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/5e0a3303d009ce95f9875a93a6dfd69f.webm?t=1747681440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/5e0a3303d009ce95f9875a93a6dfd69f.mp4?t=1747681440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Darwinia's retro-inspired, polygon-based visuals transport you to a colorful, abstract digital world that feels like a love letter to 80s classics like <i>Tron</i> and <i>Defender</i>. Its striking style, combined with fluid animations, makes it visually timeless. The game\u2019s unique blend of nostalgia and modern flair led to widespread acclaim, winning multiple prestigious awards, including the IGF's Seamus McNally Grand Prize. Now fully remastered for modern systems, Darwinia\u2019s classic charm shines as brightly today as when it first launched, making it a must-play for both old and new fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/bfc664f794423264296fb87e90d6160b.webp?t=1747681440\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introversion Software has been developing games since 2001, and stands behind acclaimed titles like Uplink, Defcon, Darwinia, Multiwinia, Prison Architect, Scanner Sombre, and their latest release, The Last Starship. Introversion has garnered both critical and commercial success being recognised with multiple awards including the IGF grand prize for Darwinia and BAFTA for best persistent game (Prison Architect).  They have sold more than 4M copies of their games worldwide.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Darwinia</i> is a unique mix of real-time strategy, action, and puzzles, featuring an innovative gesture-based control system. Save the Darwinians, battle viruses, and solve challenges to restore order in a stunning, retro-inspired digital world. Winner of multiple prestigious awards, including the Seumas McNally Grand Prize at IGF 2006, <i>Darwinia</i> is a must-play for strategy and action fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/9163bbddedadbafb49a6bc8c5518ab57.webp?t=1747681440\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/5ac0be982c8b2479dcad9da299ce8307.poster.avif?t=1747681440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/5ac0be982c8b2479dcad9da299ce8307.webm?t=1747681440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/5ac0be982c8b2479dcad9da299ce8307.mp4?t=1747681440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Step into the vibrant world of Darwinia, a digital theme park created by the eccentric Dr. Sepulveda, where evolving AI creatures called Darwinians live. Their peaceful existence is disrupted by a dangerous virus, and as a hacker, it's up to you to save them. Dive into this corrupted digital realm, battle the virus, and uncover the mysteries threatening the Darwinians' survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/6896c02abb07cac00c9b223705107541.webp?t=1747681440\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/ffc78607a4c0e945fb3ffa8672a44411.poster.avif?t=1747681440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/ffc78607a4c0e945fb3ffa8672a44411.webm?t=1747681440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/ffc78607a4c0e945fb3ffa8672a44411.mp4?t=1747681440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Darwinia blends real-time strategy, action, and puzzles in an exciting mix. Control &quot;programs&quot; to fight viruses, herd Darwinians, and complete objectives. With a unique gesture-based control system, you draw shapes to summon units, adding a fresh twist to the strategy genre. As you progress, new abilities and tougher challenges keep the gameplay engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/7be0811af043750744c476ef00a1d5e9.webp?t=1747681440\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/5e0a3303d009ce95f9875a93a6dfd69f.poster.avif?t=1747681440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/5e0a3303d009ce95f9875a93a6dfd69f.webm?t=1747681440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/5e0a3303d009ce95f9875a93a6dfd69f.mp4?t=1747681440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Darwinia's retro-inspired, polygon-based visuals transport you to a colorful, abstract digital world that feels like a love letter to 80s classics like <i>Tron</i> and <i>Defender</i>. Its striking style, combined with fluid animations, makes it visually timeless. The game\u2019s unique blend of nostalgia and modern flair led to widespread acclaim, winning multiple prestigious awards, including the IGF's Seamus McNally Grand Prize. Now fully remastered for modern systems, Darwinia\u2019s classic charm shines as brightly today as when it first launched, making it a must-play for both old and new fans alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1500/extras/bfc664f794423264296fb87e90d6160b.webp?t=1747681440\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Introversion Software has been developing games since 2001, and stands behind acclaimed titles like Uplink, Defcon, Darwinia, Multiwinia, Prison Architect, Scanner Sombre, and their latest release, The Last Starship. Introversion has garnered both critical and commercial success being recognised with multiple awards including the IGF grand prize for Darwinia and BAFTA for best persistent game (Prison Architect).  They have sold more than 4M copies of their games worldwide.</p>",
